    <!-- Wizard step descriptions (context-free) -->
    <string name="wizard_step_1_desc">Warped lets you run large language models (LLMs) directly on your device, without an internet connection. You can also connect to providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama, and LM Studio. All from one app.</string>
    <string name="wizard_step_2_desc">Warped uses Google\u0027s LiteRT-LM to run models locally on your device. LiteRT-LM is optimized for Android with GPU acceleration, delivering fast inference for .litertlm models downloaded from Hugging Face.</string>
    <string name="wizard_step_4_desc">LiteRT-LM is Google\'s inference engine, optimized for Android. It uses .litertlm models with GPU and NPU acceleration on compatible devices. Import your models from device storage.</string>
    <string name="wizard_step_5_desc">Load a local model, adjust generation parameters like temperature and context, and chat with real-time streaming responses. Everything works without internet: your conversations are private and stay on your device.</string>
    <string name="wizard_step_6_desc">Connect Warped to cloud services like OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama, and LM Studio. You can also add custom servers compatible with the OpenAI API. You bring your own API keys — we store them securely.</string>
    <string name="wizard_step_7_desc">Select a model from any of your configured providers and chat with streaming responses. Switch between local and remote models at any time from the chat selector.</string>
    <string name="wizard_step_8_desc">Save your favorite parameter settings as reusable presets. Define temperature, top-p, max tokens, seed, and more. Switch between presets instantly depending on the type of conversation you need.</string>
    <string name="wizard_step_9_desc">All your conversations are saved automatically. Browse your history, pick up chats where you left off, and organize your conversations by model or provider.</string>

